---
// src/pages/index.astro - Baqueano Natales Landing Page
const APK_URL = 'https://api-dev.baqueanonatales.com/apks/app-clientdev.apk';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Baqueano Natales | Oficios y Comercios de Puerto Natales</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Encuentra mecánicos, gasfiteros, electricistas y los mejores comercios de Puerto Natales. Agenda servicios y contacta directo." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/baqueano_icono.svg" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
      .bg-patagonia {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #064e3b 0%, #022c22 60%, #011812 100%);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-amber-500 selection:text-slate-950">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-xl bg-slate-950/80 border-b border-emerald-500/20">
      <nav class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 group">
          <img src="/assets/baqueano_icono.svg" alt="Baqueano Natales" class="h-8 w-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-105" />
          <span class="font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight text-white">Baqueano <span class="text-amber-400">Natales</span></span>
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="/locales" class="hidden sm:inline-block text-sm font-medium text-emerald-200/80 hover:text-white transition">Comercios</a>
          <a href="/descargar"
             class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-amber-500 text-slate-950 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20 active:scale-95">
            Descargar App
          </a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative pt-24 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-patagonia overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Los oficios y comercios de Puerto Natales, en tu mano
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4 leading-tight">
          Encuentra al experto<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-300 via-amber-300 to-amber-400">que necesitas hoy</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-emerald-100/80 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8 font-normal">
          Mecánicos, gasfiteros, electricistas y los mejores comercios locales. Agenda servicios, gestiona tus órdenes y contacta directo por WhatsApp.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto mb-12">
          <a href="/descargar"
             class="w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/50 transition-all active:scale-95">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9h-4V3H9v6H5l7 7 7-7zM5 18v2h14v-2H5z"/></svg>
            <span>Descargar App</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/locales"
             class="w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-200 font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all active:scale-95">
            <span>Ver Comercios</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Phone mockup con pantalla REAL de la app -->
        <div class="relative max-w-[280px] sm:max-w-[300px] mx-auto">
          <div class="relative bg-slate-950 p-2.5 rounded-[2.5rem] border-4 border-slate-800 shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-950/80">
            <div class="w-20 h-3.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-full mx-auto mb-2"></div>

            <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-900 to-slate-950 rounded-[2rem] p-4 text-left border border-emerald-500/20">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <img src="/assets/baqueano_icono.svg" class="w-6 h-6" />
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Baqueano</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Natales</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Card saludo -->
              <div class="bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl p-3 border border-emerald-500/10 mb-3">
                <p class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">¡Hola!</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-200 font-medium">¿Qué necesitas hoy?</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Cards reales de la app -->
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-2">
                <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 text-center">
                  <span class="text-base">🔧</span>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white mt-1">Oficios</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 text-center">
                  <span class="text-base">📋</span>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white mt-1">Mis órdenes</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 text-center">
                  <span class="text-base">📅</span>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white mt-1">Mis turnos</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 text-center">
                  <span class="text-base">🏪</span>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white mt-1">Comercios</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ¿Qué puedes hacer hoy? -->
    <section id="servicios" class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800/80">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">Todo lo que puedes hacer hoy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Diseñado para la comunidad de Natales y sus visitantes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all text-center group">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🔧</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-2">Encuentra oficios</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Mecánicos, gasfiteros, electricistas y técnicos verificados en Puerto Natales.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all text-center group">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📅</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-2">Agenda servicios</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Reserva turnos y gestiona tus órdenes con seguimiento en tiempo real.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all text-center group">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🏪</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-2">Descubre comercios</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Catálogo de locales locales con contacto directo por WhatsApp.</p>
            <a href="/locales" class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold hover:underline block mt-3">Ver locales →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Únete a la Red -->
    <section id="socios" class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Únete a la Red</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">Haz crecer tu negocio en Natales</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-950 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔧</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">¿Eres un experto?</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6">Mecánicos, gasfiteros, electricistas y otros oficios. Suma tu perfil, recibe clientes y gestiona tus órdenes desde la app.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/56987654321?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20sumar%20mi%20oficio%20a%20Baqueano%20Natales" target="_blank"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600/20 hover:bg-emerald-600/30 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 text-sm font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition">
              Sumar mi oficio →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-950 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🏪</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">¿Tienes un local?</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6">Comercios y servicios. Publica tu catálogo, conecta con clientes y recibe pedidos directamente.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/56987654321?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20sumar%20mi%20local%20a%20Baqueano%20Natales" target="_blank"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-amber-500/20 hover:bg-amber-500/30 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 text-sm font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition">
              Sumar mi local →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Próximamente (honesto) -->
    <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">En desarrollo</span>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2 mb-6">Estamos trabajando para traerte más servicios en Puerto Natales.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-500 text-xs">🚗 Movilidad</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-500 text-xs">🛵 Delivery</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-500 text-xs">🏨 Hospedajes</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-500 text-xs">📱 Menú QR</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 px-4 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-900 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p>© 2026 Baqueano Natales. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://api.baqueanonatales.com/legal/privacidad" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Privacidad</a>
          <a href="https://api.baqueanonatales.com/legal/terminos" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Términos</a>
          <a href="https://api.baqueanonatales.com/legal/eliminar-cuenta" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Eliminar cuenta</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-900">
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-400">Diseñado y desarrollado por <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">StudioDigital360</span></p>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
